You are improving a formula error detection agent for academic papers.

The agent reads MinerU-parsed markdown of academic papers and determines whether
reviewer-identified snippets contain genuine mathematical formula errors.
It outputs "Verdict: FORMULA_ISSUE" or "Verdict: NO_FORMULA_ISSUE".

